# Harness output. Results are per-run evidence, not source: they name real
# events, real run ids and real guest counts, and they are regenerated by
# `make eval`. Keep the ones you want as evidence somewhere deliberate (the
# pilot report), not by accident in the repo.
results/

# Real clip manifests point at real footage of real guests' faces. Only the
# documented EXAMPLE is committed; a site's own manifest is not.
manifest.json
manifest.*.json
!manifest.example.json
